    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to 42 Oak Hall, Malahide a wonderful own door 3-bedroom duplex apartment with the added benefit of a private balcony.  This spacious home is superbly located within easy walking distance to Malahide Village and Malahide Castle & Demesne. \r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of an entrance hall with a large understair storage closet, guest wc, modern open plan style kitchen / living & dining room with doors leading to a private outdoor living space. Upstairs consists of three spacious bedrooms all with an abundance of fitted wardrobes, master en suite and a large family bathroom. There is also a large attic for storage purposes.\r\nOak Hall is within a stone’s throw of a whole host of amenities, including shops, bus routes, schools and 5 minutes’ walk to Malahide Village which offers an excellent selection of restaurants, cafés, bars and boutique shops, together with superb transport links providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t                   5.18 x 2.11   \tDecorative timber floor, coving, security alarm, large under stair storage closet\r\nGuest WC          2.10 x 1.76\t        Tiled floor, wc, whb, spotlights, holders, large mirror, plumbed for washer / dryer\r\n \r\nKitchen\t           5.25 x 2.89\t      Tiled floor, fitted units, gorenje double oven, gorenje extractor fan, tile backsplash\r\n\r\nLounge / Diner     5.25 x 4.20         Double doors to Balcony\r\n ( into bay)\r\nBalcony\t           1.86 x 4.27       Decorative timber floor, coving, spotlights, doors to large outdoor terrace\r\n\r\nStairs/Landing\t\t                   Hot press, access to attic\r\nBathroom\t 2.85 x 2.27\t   Tiled floor& walls, bath suite, shower screen, mirrored cabinet, mirror, shave light, wc, whb\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 \t5.10 x 3.30\t    Abundance of fitted wardrobes\r\n\tEn Suite\t1.97 x 1.66\tTiled floor & partial tiled walls, walk in shower, heated rail, spotlights, handheld shower head, mirrored cabinet\r\nBedroom 2\t5.10 x 3.55\t Double fitted wardrobe\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 3\t3.80 x 2.30\tFitted wardrobes, built in office station"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tLarge Outdoor Balcony\r\n•\tAmple Car Parking Spaces\r\n•\t3 Sizeable Bedrooms\r\n•\tAppliances Included\t\r\n•\tWalking distance to Malahide Village\r\n•\tPresented in Excellent Condition \r\n•\tSpacious Accommodation (circa. 105 sq.m)"
      },
